Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I can smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to find places\Nthat allow it these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a smoker is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the good news, Imoko's school\Ntrip to Kyoto starts today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I can smoke at home as\Nmuch as I want and I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies, but I'm afraid this\Ncafe only allows e-cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma 'am, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is a big dream. Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me. You will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Me. You will see. Me. You will see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finished, finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You will see me. You will see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only be high if it's only\Na star, it'll only be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But... 3401!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,3401!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,3401! 3401! 0101!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in Kyoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at it, it's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Imoko... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember we're in high school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a little weird to\Nbe this excited over a temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see? All the...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fan of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.86,0:02:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this place is famous,\Nbut I do have a few suggestions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'd move all the\Ntemples into the same area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it less like, you know, that\Ntourist trap of a clock tower up north.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then people won't feel so disappointed\Nwhen they show up and see just this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what\NI'm hearing! Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can think of some things\NI'd like to see, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, yeah, I think that could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We could use Nintendo's overseas\Nprofits to fund big parades.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And build a VR facility where guests\Ncan play, like, VR Samurai Raid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoto remains the heart and\Nsoul of Japanese culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To twist it to fit modern\Nsensibilities devalues our history.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If twisting it for modern sensibilities\Ndevalues our history, Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,what's with the cat ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Ashitaka Yoshimitsu\Nhad a huge beast folk fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking the only twisted\Nthing here was his kink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's giving Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.66,0:03:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were so\Nmany smoking areas in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This place does get millions of\Nvisitors from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The sign says you'll get fined a thousand\Nbucks if you smoke on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's better than\Nsmoking around everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that make you think of your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've suddenly started getting worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Yoni hurts herself or gets sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that I could do from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't think Mom\Nwould be much of a help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Imoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Trips like this don't happen every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family can wait this one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you to whatever gods in\NKyoto for all the smoking areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure the gods didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I didn't forget\Nthat 10 bucks I lent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoto rent-room time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Kyoto out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Research for my manga series.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I pulled some all-nighters\Nto finish my deadlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, y 'all, get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A Kyoto adventure has\Nalways been on my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and to celebrate, I\Ngot myself a brand new car!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making buy a new car money?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been getting some great\Nroyalties from all my manga sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, this is a research trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The company's gonna cover everything\Nso we can do whatever we want!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna try Kyoto cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like write-offs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember to get receipts, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The city has height restrictions\Nto protect the scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry after that drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat something\Nyou can only get in Kyoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Beef falls for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, you were the one\Nwho brought us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is being cheap in my blood? That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, let's tear this city up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll charge it to my work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We travel only by catch-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Luxury for the win!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure your company's\Ngonna pay for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fortune time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys just get all\Nthe ambulance you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine's the best one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, and what's my fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The legend says, if you hate the results,\Nkeep pulling until you get some good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorta defeats the purpose, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go full tilt boogie, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see why this place is famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, we're up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't I be having the\Ntime of my life right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm being summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatsuru, what are you doing, you dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your job really give you\Na blank check for this trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the company's really going\Nto cover it, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:06:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck hot pot! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so damn good, so fucking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had hot pot before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuro was really\Nletting loose, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She wasn't joking when she said\Nshe was stressed out, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've\Nseen her have this much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow we're doing\Nthe pitch black tunnel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,tour where we can't see or hear anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna get murdered or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot what peace and quiet felt\Nlike with all that beast folk riffraff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This bottle might be too toasty, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aruneko, she's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if\Nthey're all out getting shitfaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This video was captured by the streamers\NWhen they visited the abandoned building
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is freaky They say that a murder\Nhappened in this room 20 years ago Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's scary Come on, you're on video,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so hurry up Can't believe I found a spooky
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,show on TV Kind of rare\Nthese days What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an altar. Out of unstoppable\Ncuriosity, one of the streamers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,approaches the Buddhist altar\Nin the corner And at that moment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something behind you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 2026, and this is where\Nour special effects are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at these actors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got to act the hell out of\Nthis with these so-called ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be anyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, whose apartment\Nshould I house-sit tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be all that sucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess having that Beast Folk\Nriff-raff around isn't so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come home anytime now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This pitch black temple hall\Nis known as the Anus Tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an era where the Beast\NFolk population was in steep decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Cat Buddha declared that Beast Folk
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,be born through both the\NBirth Canal and Anus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This sacred hall honors that legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've penetrated its deepest depths,\Nyou'll find the Beast Folk's stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Receive its blessing by\Ntouching it before leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something I'm not getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If it costs money, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Six tickets, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With a receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew something was up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting strange again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on. Wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This temple corridor is the anus\Ntour, blah, blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark places really get your heart racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't kidding when\Nhe said pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't see anything\Nat all. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, we can guide\Nourselves with the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like Imoko really likes living\Non the edge with things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is it\Nstarting to stink in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it smells like cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:11:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone would\Nactually smoke in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, there are\Nbutts all over the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I just stepped on some!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting brighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look, Yomuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Beast Folk Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sacred Beast Folk Stone is\Nbelieved to have created Beast Folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In times of crisis,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it served as the Cat Buddha's vessel\Nand would talk down to its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense the spiritual power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, could I use this for inspiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I can feel the\Nweight of history. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's been putting out their\Nbutts on this sacred stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How inconsiderate can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet the criminal was trying\Nto hide their desecration, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell whoever did this\Nwas nothing but a failure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,about how they couldn't\Neven clean up their mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole way out was\Nlittered with butts, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This sacred temple tour was ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't see any\Nsigns saying no smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you shouldn't litter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes you wonder what kind\Nof parent raised them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure did sound like little\Nsis's voice for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I saw a trash can\Nwe can ditch these butts in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I got rid of them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.22,0:12:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Being able to smoke at\Nhome is the absolute best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Miju Castle is the ancient location where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokugawa Yoshinobu\Ndeclared the Nyansei Hokan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle tour shows\Nyou aspects of beast folk
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,history that they don't\Nteach you in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Nyansei Hokan you mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a declaration made by\Nthe Tokugawa Shogunate that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,gave ownership of beast folk\Nto the imperial government.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's head\Ninside and start the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The art of Nyado was very\Npopular during the Edo Shogunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This exhibition displays a variety of\Nitems belonging to a late Nyado master,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Furuta Nyado. Nyado?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans and beast folk have been\Non good terms for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,During this era,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the beast folk would dress in unique\Ncostumes and perform special tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds kind of kinky to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The value of just one of these\Noutfits could buy a whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The skimpier the outfit, the better,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,as more skin meant the sound produced\Nfrom the repeated impacts was cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeated impacts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, that sounds intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The next exhibition is right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They let us take photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew the details of bespoke\Nhistory with this, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they definitely had it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at those antique G-strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, but at least we all\Nget along these days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What doesn't kill you makes\Nyou stronger, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Conqueror writes history!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:14:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,These wax figures have been arranged to\Nrecreate the scene of the Nyansei Hokan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing he's giving her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mysterious jewelry we still\Ndon't fully understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,After the Boshin War, the\NBeast Folk population declined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After the Nyansei Hokan,\Nthey relocated elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There, the population\Nthrives even to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, is it fair to say\Nthat they're our ancestors too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the theory is, aside\Nfrom the girls in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the increase in the Beast Folk\Npopulation is directly related
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to the nomadic tribes continuing\Nto hide throughout the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does that sound like\Nthe Hidden Christians?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Displayed are a number of weapons\Nused by Beast Folk in wartime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all bamboo spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are bamboo spears the\Nstrongest or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the crying bamboo spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This unique weapon was gifted to\NBeast Folk who achieved greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When that button is pressed, the\Nspear lets out an adorable cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:14:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a more powerful spear\Nknown as the Triple Crying Spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was bestowed upon a\Nworthy Beast Folk leader
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,who earned the title\NNightmare of the Battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But at the conclusion of the war,\Nthey took the spear and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A great loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the spear had three different voice types\Nand even featured an alarm function.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure they didn't just\Nthrow that useless thing away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think something is\Nwrong with my spear buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My wake-up alarm isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,See, look, look, they\Nbow their heads and beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,for deer crackers yeah right he's so cute
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:16:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,a bunch of them are coming over now Wow
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got an idea.\NLet's see if the deer
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah give me yeah give me yeah what's\Nhappening yeah give me yeah it's not a deer
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but why not well that's\Nwhat going Crackers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like the crackers can't be that good
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that's good streaming content,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you want to bet she was\Nmessing the deer for her audience
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gone too far, you filthy beast.\NFolk those crackers belong to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am known as the Demon King. You have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,encroached on our territory as the servant
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,sovereign I cannot tolerate such\Ndisrespect from a beast folk just take the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,cracker already how dare you get that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,cracker out of my face\NI can't stop my body
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,From bowing? Hey, Yani,\Nhuh? Wait, where did
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani, go. Maybe nature calls. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a time when we were\Na proud, magnificent species.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of us possessed the intellectual
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,power to reign supreme\Namongst our hooved kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We even fought you beast folk\Nin a battle for dominance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, we began to lose\Nour cunning intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We became pathetic shells of ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,shamelessly begging for\Ncrackers from tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We were wiser and more insightful\Nthan even you beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, please, I am the only\Nremaining deer with any intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to say I am sliding\Nmore and more into a haze.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I look upon you with envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Being the last of my\Nkind is a lonely affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd much rather have lost all reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Beastfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever pondered that thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And just where are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My head, I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My consciousness is growing dim again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that the future of\Nyour species is blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just went through hell\Nwith some crazy fucking deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than one crazy fucking deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Car's packed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready to go, right? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. Pile in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just six short hours till we get home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the most creative when I'm\Nsomewhere that I can't work on my manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know exactly what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be something with dopamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like, because I can't,\Nthat's all I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really rough for me when\NI didn't have my freedom either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to write a letter home,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.90,0:19:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but the ballpoint pen started\Nlooking all weird Before I knew it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,my arms were covered in\Nall these tiny black spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was finally\Nable to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.72,0:20:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to reach you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't lose your phone\Nor something, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get a lot of chances to travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so I didn't want to have\Nmy face in my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of that, I've\Ngot some great ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This trip was a total success.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a new story in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine this, a war between\Nancestors and a flashback arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pitch it to you right\Nnow, if you have a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your series has been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That design is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute, but classy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get that for your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it can ward off evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they're made of bamboo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With the way she lives,\Nshe could die any day now.
